# One day → one tier

When adding **new live-feedback** rows to `docs/issues-priority.md`, one calendar day gets at most one new tier.

The initial planned backlog (Tiers 1–7, filed at project start) is a work-order sequence. Do not collapse it. Do not invent Tier 8 on the same date as another new live-feedback tier.

If today's date already has a live-feedback tier, append to that tier.
